WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.304
Welcome back!

00:00:01.304 --> 00:00:07.526
For dis lesson, we go learn Excel and Google Sheets from zero.

00:00:07.526 --> 00:00:09.432
No fear, e no hard.

00:00:10.132 --> 00:00:12.566
Excel na like big table.

00:00:12.566 --> 00:00:16.419
Row dey go across, column dey go down.

00:00:16.419 --> 00:00:21.489
Di small box wey dem meet, na im we dey call cell.

00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:22.300
Like B2.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.083
Dis four formula go do plenty work for you.

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:29.172
SUM go add everything.

00:00:29.172 --> 00:00:32.590
AVERAGE go show you di normal level.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.008
MAX na di highest, MIN na di lowest.

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:39.689
When you finish, save your file as CSV.

00:00:39.689 --> 00:00:47.028
Na dis kind file you go put inside Data Wey Talk, and e go show you wetin your numbers dey talk.

00:00:47.728 --> 00:00:50.473
No more calculator and headache.

00:00:50.473 --> 00:00:55.792
Di sheet go calculate for you, fast, and e no go make mistake.

00:00:56.492 --> 00:01:02.468
Try am today: put one week of your sales for Excel and use SUM.

00:01:02.468 --> 00:01:04.460
See you for Module 3!
